The  system call directs the kernel to open a new audit trail log
file.  It requires an appropriate  privilege.   The  system  call
opens  new files, but is used to disable the audit log.  The sys‐
tem call will fail if: The path is invalid.  The process does not
have  sufficient  permission  to  complete  the  operation.   The
